Package: ggGenomicTracks
Title: Build genomic track visualizations within the ggplot2 framework
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Patrick", "Blaney", , "patrick.blaney@nyulangone.org", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9319-8866"))
Description: The 'ggplot2' universe of visualization in R provides extensive customization
    of plots and their components. 'ggGenomicTracks' bridges the gap between the 'ggplot2'
    extensions to create genomic track or browser-like stacked plots at loci of interest.
